window.docContents[42].resolve({"/LindenstraussPolynomials/Chain/#mod-doc-LindenstraussPolynomials___Chain-1-0":{"contents":"Ordered compositions of substitutions\n\nThe composition S_1(t_1)\\,S_2(t_2)\\cdots S_d(t_d)\\,x, where S_i(t)\\,y=(1-t)\\,y+t\\,f_i(y)\\,u_i. As in the article, the operators act from right to left: S_d(t_d) is applied first and S_1(t_1) last. Each S_i(t) is a linear contraction when \\|f_i\\|\\le1 and \\|u_i\\|\\le1.\n\n\n","context":"","header":"LindenstraussPolynomials.Chain","id":"/LindenstraussPolynomials/Chain/#mod-doc-LindenstraussPolynomials___Chain-1-0"}});